              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "khel, with the breath on the first sound",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *khel*, with the breath on the first sound]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "khel",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *khel*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "CONTRAST",
              "instruction": "khel said with the puff, and the same shape said without it",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU CONTRAST: *khel* said with the puff, and the same shape said without it]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does खेल (khel) mean? (\"a game\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HI-C70-play",
      "sequence": 2940,
      "title": "खेलना (khelnā) — to play",
      "headword": "खेलना",
      "romanization": "khelnā",
      "gloss": "to play",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:13d3606b20217cf9",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say khel, then write खेल: ख, then े above it, then ल."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: खेलना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खेलना (khelnā) — \"to play\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The same खेल (khel) you learnt in the last lesson, with -ना on the end. That is the whole of it: Hindi makes a doing word out of a naming word by adding those two letters, and you have now watched it happen once."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Look at what that gives you. जाना was built the same way, and so were बोलना, लिखना, सुनना. Four you already own and one you have just made — the ending is a tool, not a list to memorise."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मैं खेलता हूँ is \"I play\", in the frame you have used since मैं हिंदी बोलता हूँ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A game, and the doing word that comes out of it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "read जाना, then say it without looking",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: read **जाना**, then say it without looking]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "khel, then khelnā",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *khel*, then *khelnā*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "maiṁ kheltā hūṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
